                <pb facs="0780" n="686" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg686"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5231/352: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Moore</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-04-07T17:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 7, 1924—5
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 7—5 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>16. Your cipher telegram of April 4, 5 p.m. Urgent prorogation present <hi
                        rendition="#italic">iwdus vivendi</hi> without modification for 6 months or
                    year seems utmost that can be accomplished under existing circumstances. Since I
                    am to see General Primo de Rivera very soon, please cable soonest possible
                    whether I may accept for our Government such a solution if proffered.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
